[00:00.00] 作词 : Olivia Rodrigo/Daniel Nigro
[00:00.00][by:维尔日记]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Olivia Rodrigo/Daniel Nigro
[00:13.73]Knew a boy once, when I was small
[00:13.73]童年那会儿 认识了一个男孩
[00:16.83]A tow-head blond, with eyes of salt
[00:16.83]一头金发的他 两眼泛着苦意
[00:20.01]He played the drum in the marching band
[00:20.01]他是校乐队的鼓手
[00:25.56]His parents cared more about the Bible
[00:25.56]他的父母信奉圣经
[00:29.14]Than being good to their own child
[00:29.14]对自己的孩子却漠不关心
[00:32.22]He wore long sleeves 'cause of his dad
[00:32.22]他总穿长袖 将伤疤掩藏
[00:36.02]
[00:37.34]And somehow, we fell out of touch
[00:37.34]时变境迁 我们失去了联系
[00:43.11]Hope he took his bad deal and made a royal flush
[00:43.11]但愿他摆脱了那一切 过上了美好的生活
[00:49.50]Don't know if I'll see you again someday
[00:49.50]不知我们是否会重逢
[00:55.62]But if you're out there, I hope that you're okay
[00:55.62]我只希望你一切安好
[01:11.50]
[01:15.24]My middle school friend grew up alone
[01:15.24]中学那会儿 有个朋友很早就自力更生
[01:18.32]She raised her brothers on her own
[01:18.32]还靠自己供养了几个兄弟
[01:21.49]Her parents hated who she loved
[01:21.49]她的父母从不待见她所爱的人们
[01:27.53]She couldn't wait to go to college
[01:27.53]她只想快点离家去念大学
[01:30.74]She was tired 'cause she was brought
[01:30.74]生在这么个没有爱的家庭
[01:33.59]Into a world where family was merely blood
[01:33.59]她很苦倦
[01:38.33]
[01:38.70]Does she know how proud I am she was created
[01:38.70]我好想让她知道 我很为她骄傲
[01:44.81]With the courage to unlearn all of their hatred
[01:44.81]能够不顾一切阻挠向前走
[01:51.22]We don't talk much but I just gotta say
[01:51.22]我们不常说话 但我想跟她说
[01:56.91]"I miss you, and I hope that you're okay"
[01:56.91]“我一直挂念着你 希望你一切安好”
[02:03.94]
[02:04.45]Address the letters, to the holes in my butterfly wings
[02:04.45]写这些信 只为填全我心中的缺洞
[02:10.29]Nothing's forever, nothing is as good as it seems
[02:10.29]没什么是永恒的 也没有绝对的好事
[02:16.45]And when the clouds won't iron out
[02:16.45]天边阴云密布
[02:19.60]And the monsters creep into your house
[02:19.60]恶魔侵扰你的住所
[02:22.65]And every door is hard to close
[02:22.65]所有心门都没法紧闭
[02:26.64]
[02:26.97]Well, I hope you know how proud I am you were created
[02:26.97]我想让你知道
[02:34.08]With the courage to unlearn all of their hatred
[02:34.08]你能如此坚强我真的为你高兴
[02:40.43]God, I hope that you're happier today
[02:40.43]希望你今天幸福快乐
[02:46.46]'Cause I love you, and I hope that you're okay
[02:46.46]要记住我很爱你 我只愿你一切安好
